"target=\"_blank\">jQuery UI ThemeRoller</a> ସହିତ ସୃଷ୍ଟି କରାଯାଇପାରିବ।"

#: views/admin/settings_front_end_themes.view.php:16
msgid ""
"On the page \"Theme Roller\" you can customize all features or pick one set "
